 "description": "<p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/vejret/byvejr/by/vis/GL/4320/Danmarkshavn,%20Gr%C3%B8nland/\">Weather forecast</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/arkiver/vejrarkiv/\">Weather archive</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/uploads/pics/klima_danmarkshavn.png\">Climate</a></p><p>DMI weather and radio sounding station 04320</p><p>Elevation 11 m</p><p>Balloon borne radiosoundings every 12 hours measuring vertical profile of temperature, perssure, humidity and winds.</p><p>DMIs standard Automatic weather station measures: Air Temperature, humidity, atmospheric pressure, windspeed and -direction every hour.</p><p>At selected weather stations (where 220V power and common communication is available) the stations typically measures some additional parameters.</p><p>A complete reference of which data is available from DMI weather stations in Greenland  can be found in the annual updated report &nbsp;[Weather observations from Greenland 1958-20xx - Observation data with description] at <a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/laer-om/generelt/dmi-publikationer/tekniske-rapporter/\">http://www.dmi.dk/laer-om/generelt/dmi-publikationer/tekniske-rapporter/</a></p>",
